    "Reduce series and parallel capacitor networks and track charge and voltage through them",
    "Predict how $C$, $Q$, $V$, $E$ and $U$ change when a dielectric is inserted with the battery connected versus disconnected",
    "Find the capacitance of a capacitor with non-uniform gap or position-dependent permittivity by slicing and integrating",
